    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u25b6 Proportional projection of CG background to draw map objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Localized subtitles create situations that are most consistent with real-life dialogue and the\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 use of local dialects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story summary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Angel is an ordinary third-year college girl. Because she is usually too careless, it is difficult to find a job in a good NGO. She can only go to some unusual places for internships.And to make matters worse, because too many subjects were failed, she needed to retake them, could not even make up the normal working hours, so she had to agree to work as a &quot;sex volunteer&quot; for the organization to earn extra hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    &quot;At worst, it's just a handjob for people in need!&quot; Angel thought simply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    However, what she doesn't know is that in the future, in addition to cases of applying for sex volunteers, there will be more people around her who will need her &quot;services&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>future plans</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    This is the first work of our team. It cannot be said to be very mature, but it is definitely 100% attentive.Because our team insists on providing plot descriptions that are most relevant to local culture, we do not currently provide multi-lingual subtitles due to insufficient team manpower and budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    If we have spare capacity in the future, our team will work hard to provide more high-quality works and expand into other languages. Thank you for your support and understanding.</p>",
